@DeepNotShallow Haha you mean less auto thefts and accidents?

“One of the metrics used for safety was the car theft rate, which is something Denver and its neighboring city, Aurora, ranked particularly high in.
Denver and Aurora are tied with Memphis, Oakland, and St. Louis.”

@Mark_J_Ryan @bendreyfuss There is a far left faction which can’t seem to process that the vast majority of people don’t routinely commit crimes.
It’s ok to admit we want to have laws and enforce them.
Accepting car theft as normal is self destructive behavior for a society.
